@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@recordId = PASTE_RECORD_ID_HERE

### Upload two sample bills, run the pipeline, and anchor a record
# Click "Send Request" above this line (needs the REST Client extension)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=GreenPassBoundary

--GreenPassBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="companyId"

Tunisian SME_x
--GreenPassBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="period"

2026-09
--GreenPassBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documents"; filename="electricity-bill.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Supplier: STEG. Date: 2026-09-30. Consumption: 1850 kWh.
--GreenPassBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documents"; filename="diesel-invoice.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Supplier: Agil Tunisie. Date: 2026-09-28. Quantity: 420 L diesel.
--GreenPassBoundary--

### List every anchored record
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records

### Verify a record — copy its recordId into @recordId above first
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{recordId}}/verify

### DEMO ONLY — edit the stored value without touching the anchored hash
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{recordId}}/tamper

### Re-run verify after the tamper call above to see it fail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/records/{{recordId}}/verify
